	(text "LED supply: bridge JP2 A-C for VCC (3.3 V, up to the regulator's 1 A) or B-C for J6\n(external supply up to 5 V, for full brightness). Never from the battery: RAW is the\ncharger's battery pin. Q1 switches it onto LED_VDD when P1.00 (LED_EN) is high;\nR1/R2 keep it off during boot. ZMK: ext-power on P1.00, VCC kept on by a gpio-hog.\nClose JP1 to drive the LEDs from P0.06. U2 shifts the data level for a 5 V supply;\nwith VCC, leave U2 and C2 off and bridge JP3 instead."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "51796ff0-0ee0-4d71-b1ec-b3dea5113883")
	)
