	(text "J5: optical sensor (PAW3395 / PMW3360) instead of the trackpad, over SPI:\nSCK = P0.20, MOSI = P0.17, MISO = P0.24, CS = P0.11, MOTION = P0.22, RST = NRST.\nSCK/MOSI/MOTION share the trackpad's SCL/SDA/RDY: fit one or the other, and leave\nR3/R4 off with a sensor. Check the sensor board's supply: some want 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22e8140a-84e5-44b9-afad-da8efa432d76")
	)
	(text "Trackpad: Azoteq TPS43 (IQS572), I2C at 1.65-3.6 V.\nJ2 is six bare pads for short wires to the module's own pads (no FPC, keeps it thin),\nin the module's order: SDA, SCL, 3V3, GND, RST, RDY (datasheet v1.06, figure 2.1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "398869a6-a120-4cb3-a425-2a7641767058")
	)
